<h2>2. Personal data processed</h2>
<p>Amber Muscle processes the following personal data through the website ambermuscle.com:</p>
<h3>2.1 Browsing data (collected automatically)</h3>
<p>When accessing the Website, the Google Analytics 4 analytics service collects technical and usage data, including: IP address (anonymised in transit), approximate country and city, device type, operating system, browser, language, pages visited, time spent, traffic source and interaction events (clicks, scroll, plays).</p>
<h3>2.2 Technical data from third-party services</h3>
<p>When loading typographic fonts from Google Fonts (fonts.googleapis.com and fonts.gstatic.com), the service records the User&#x27;s IP address. Google applies its own privacy policies to this processing.</p>
<h3>2.3 Voluntarily provided data</h3>
<p>If the User contacts Amber Muscle through the contact form hosted on the WordPress platform linked to the Website, the data voluntarily provided will be processed: name, email address, content of the message and any other information shared in the communication.</p>
<p>The Website does NOT collect personal data through its own forms, account registration, subscriptions or purchases.</p>
<h2>3. Purposes and lawful bases of processing</h2>
<p>Personal data are processed for the following purposes and on the following lawful bases:</p>
