<p>Purpose: to understand how Users interact with the Website in order to improve its usability, content and performance.</p>
<p>Lawful basis: the User&#x27;s consent given through the cookie banner (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR), or the legitimate interest of Amber Muscle in improving the Website (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR) in the case of strictly aggregated technical data and cookies.</p>
<h3>3.2 Typographic font service</h3>
<p>Purpose: to display the content of the Website with appropriate typography.</p>
<p>Lawful basis: the legitimate interest of Amber Muscle in providing an adequate browsing experience (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR).</p>
<h3>3.3 Handling enquiries and communications</h3>
<p>Purpose: to respond to enquiries, requests for information or any communication addressed to Amber Muscle by the User.</p>
<p>Lawful basis: the User&#x27;s consent upon initiating the communication (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR) and, where applicable, the performance of pre-contractual measures (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR).</p>
<h3>3.4 Compliance with legal obligations</h3>
<p>Purpose: to comply with the legal obligations applicable to Amber Muscle, including those of a commercial, fiscal or tax nature.</p>
<p>Lawful basis: compliance with a legal obligation (Art. 6(1)(c) GDPR).</p>
<h2>4. Retention periods</h2>
