<p>Amber Muscle adopts appropriate technical and organisational measures to ensure a level of security appropriate to the risk of processing, in accordance with Article 32 GDPR. These measures include, among others, encryption in transit via HTTPS, restricted access to data and the periodic review of security configurations.</p>
<p>Amber Muscle further reminds users that the MyEliteHealth application has been designed in accordance with the principle of privacy by design and by default (Art. 25 GDPR).</p>
